l\nworking ranch, surrounded by the beautiful\ncliffs of the Grand Staircase, ancient native\nsites, cabins, the historic Monkey House, and\nof course Mollie\'s Nipple!\nFounded by locals who know and love the\nATV Tours, Horseback, Via Ferrata, Rappelling area, who grew up exploring and have\npassion for adventure. Variety of tour options\navailable.\nScenic trail rides into the Grand Staircase-\nEscalante & Paria Wilderness area.\nTake a scenic flight over regional scenic\nwonders such as Zion National Park, Coral\nPink Sand Dunes, Grand Canyon, and Grand\nStaircase in a Waco Biplane or Cessna 195.\nJeep tours on the east side of Zion specializing\nin slot canyons; ride and find arches,\npetroglyphs, and Indian ruins.\nExceptional hiking, photographic, and scenic\ntours suited to your abilities and led by an\nartist/archaeologist.\n#1 Nighttime Attraction in Kanab - view the\nstars with lasers, optics, music & dancing.\nClosest UTV/ATV rentals to Kanab. Rent\n4-seaters or 2-seaters depending on your\nneeds. Polaris Slingshot UTVs are available\nas well.\nGuided horseback tours for guests of any\nriding ability. Choose from 1, 2 or 4 hour\nrides through the mountain surrounding\nZion National Park.\nThis 4,000 acre ranch located just outside Zion\nNational Park offers a wide variety of adventures.\nSouthern Utah Guides and Outfitters\nA TASTE OF ADVENTURE\n51 \\n\\n CONTINENTAL\nBREAKFAST\n=FULL\nBREAKFAST SERVICE\nor luxury\nPLACES TO STAY\nChoose rustic, historic,\n52\nCOMPANY\nΚΑΝΑΒ\nHOTELS & MOTELS\nAIKEN\'S LODGE\nBEST FRIENDS ROADHOUSE\nBEST WESTERN RED HILLS\nCANYONS BOUTIQUE HOTEL\nCANYONS LODGE\nCOMFORT SUITES\nDAYS INN & SUITES\nFLAGSTONE STUDIOS\nHAMPTON INN\nHOLIDAY INN EXPRESS & SUITES\nKANAB SUITES\nLAQUINTA INN AND SUITES\nPARRY LODGE\nQUAIL PARK LODGE\nQUALITY INN\nRED CANYON CABINS\nRED ROCK COUNTRY INN\nRODEWAY INN\nSUN-N-SAND MOTEL\nTIMBER AND TIN\nTRAVELER\'S MOTEL\nTRAVELODGE\nBED & BREAKFAST/INNS\nBEST FRIENDS COTTAGES\nCOWBOY BUNKHOUSE HOSTEL