darkskyrv.com\n435.657.6100• gprvresort.com\n435.644.2142 hitchnpostrvpark.com\n435.899.1956 jandirvpark.com\n435.644.5330 • kanabrvcorral.com\n435.644.1200. recreation.gov\n877.444.6777. recreation.gov\n435.580.8185. duckcreekvillagerv.com\n877.444.6777. recreation.gov\n877.444.6777. recreation.gov\n877.444.6777. recreation.gov\n435.648.2203.zionnational-park.com/rvpark\n435.648.3302 • hiroadbasecamp.com\n435.648.2323. slaynearzion.com\n435.648.2703 • zioncrestcampground.com\n888.648.2564 • bauersrv.com\n435.648.2490 • brycezioncampground.net\n435.684.3032 • lakepowell.com/rv-campin\n435.675.5803\n888.896.3829. lakepowell.com/rv-campin\n435.868.1020 cliffsideca binsandrvpark.com \\n\\n GETTING HERE...\nINTERNATIONAL AIRPORT\nThree major International airports serve\nSouthern Utah.\n• Las Vegas/McCarran International\nAirport in Las Vegas, Nevada (LAS)\nDrive time to Kanab is three hours.\n• Salt Lake City (SLC)\nDrive time to Kanab is five hours.\n●\nPhoenix Arizona (PHX)\nDrive time to Kanab is five and a half hours.\n●\nConnecting flights to St. George,\nUT (SGU) bring you closer to Kanab. Drive\ntime from St. George to Kanab is\n90 minutes. Private transportation is\navailable between St. George and Kanab.\nFor driving directions, visit:\nVisitSouthernUtah.com/Getting-here.\n• Car rentals are available at the airports.\nIf you expect to do any backcountry driving\nyou will want to rent a 4x4 with high carriage.\nSet Your Clock! Kanab located in the\nMountain Time Zone, one hour ahead of\nLas Vegas.\nLOCAL VISITOR & TOURISM CENTERS\nFor all the help you need planning your\ntrip, finding maps and brochures, contact\nthe Kane County Office of Tourism.\nWe\'ll get your adventure off to a good start.\nKane County Office of Tourism\n78 S 100 E, Kanab, UT 84741\n435.644.5033 800.SEE.KANE\nVisitSouthern Utah.com\nHours year-long: Monday - Friday\n8:00 AM - 5:00 PM with extended\nsummer hours and during special events.\nBLM Visitor Centers are also a wealth of\ninformation. Rangers will provide detailed\ninformation on trails and hiking conditions.\nGrand Staircase-Escalante\nNational Monument Visitor Center\n(Archaeology & Geology theme)\n745 E Hwy 89, Kanab, UT 84741\n435.644.1300\nHours year-long: 8:00 AM - 4:30 PM;\nClosed weekends during the winter.\nBig Water Visitor Center\n(Paleontology theme with real dinosaur fossils)\n20 Revolution Way, Big Water, UT 84741\n435.675.3200\nSummer Hours: 8:30 AM - 4:30 PM\nWinter Hours: 8:00 AM - 4:30 PM\n(Tuesday - Saturday)\nGETTING HERE & FINDING INFO\n55 \\n\\n RESTAURANTS\nHomestyle to gourmet\nRESTAURANT\nΚΑΝΑΒ\nASAVA JUICE & SMOOTHIES\nBIG AL\'S JUNCTION DRIVE-IN\nCAVE CAFE\nESCOBARS\nFUSION HOUSE\nHAPPY TRAILS FAMILY BBQ\nHAVANA CABANA\nHOUSTON\'S TRAILS END\nIRON HORSE RESTAURANT\n& SALOON\nJAKEY LEIGH\'S\nKANAB CREEK BAKERY\nLOTSA MOTSA PIZZA\nLUO\'S CHINESE RESTAURANT\nMCDONALD\'S\nTHE MOON SALOON\nPEEKABOO WOOD\nFIRED KITCHEN\nPIZZA HUT\nROCKING V CAFÉ\nSEGO\nTHE SODA FOUNTAIN\n56 VISITSOUTHERNUTAH.COM\nADDRESS\n176 S 100 E\n185 E 300 S\n4581 US-89\n373 E 300 S\n18 E Center St\n150 S 100 E\n89 & 89A Junction\n32 E Center St\n78 E Center St\n4 E Center St\n238 W Center St\n164 E 300 S\n365 S 100 E\n159 E 300 S\n150 S 100 E\n233 W Center St\n421 S 100 E\n97 W Center St\n190 N 300 W\n176 W Center St\nPHONE #\n435.644.2637\n435.644.8170\n435.644.8525\n435.644.3739\n435.644.8868\n801.915.4894\n435.879.9605\n435.644.2488\n435.644.2277\n435.644.8191\n435.644.5689\n435.644.3388\n435.644.5592\n435.644.5563\n435.644.2350\n435.689.1959\n435.644.2513\n435.644.8001\n435.644.5680\n435.644.3401\nWEBSITE\nasavajuice.life\nmoqui-cave.com\nfusionhousekanab.com\nhappy-trails-bbq.business.site\nlahavanacabana.com\nhoustons.net\nironhorsekanab.com\nka na bcreekbakery.com\nluoscafechinese.com\nmcdonalds.com\ncrescentmoonkanab.com\npeekabookitchen.com\npizzahut.com\nrockingvcafe.com\nsegokanab.com\nkana buniteddrug.com/\nsoda-fountain\nTYPE OF FOOD\nOrganic Juices and\nSmoothies made in house\nSandwic